The runner bundles buzz-app modules unchanged at the revision in
runner/src/constants.ts (BUZZ_APP_REV). These files repeat or adapt
buzz-app code; each marks the copied lines in a source comment:

- runner/src/harnesses.ts: model and effort labels and the Claude model
  catalog, from src/bundled/claude-code/runtime.ts.
- runner/src/codex-engine.ts: the Codex turn rules, from
  src/bundled/codex/runtime.ts.
- runner/src/mcp-server.ts: the loopback MCP request rules, from
  src-tauri/src/host_mcp.rs.
- runner/src/publish.ts: the relay publish method, from src/buzz-mcp.
- runner/src/runtime.ts: host code shared with src/bundled/*/runtime.ts.
- runner/deploy/pi-launch.mjs: adapted from src/bundled/pi/launch.mjs.

Harness marks in plugin/plugin.js identify each harness. They are reused
from buzz-app (src/shared/design-system/icons/HarnessLogos.tsx and the
bundled harness icons), which credits them as follows:

- Goose: from block/goose, documentation/static/img/goose.svg.
  Apache-2.0, Copyright Block, Inc. goose is a trademark of LF Projects.
- Pi: from earendil-works/pi-website, src/favicon.svg. MIT License,
